# Client confidential data must NEVER be committed: this repo syncs to a hosted
# remote (GitHub + Lovable auto-commits). Only the directory README is tracked.
VENTURE/clients/*
!VENTURE/clients/README.md
# _packages.md is the operator's own service-package definitions — no client data.
!VENTURE/clients/_packages.md

# Portfolio case-study bulk data (public dataset, ~20MB) stays out of git; a
# 500-row sample is committed and CASE_STUDY.md documents full regeneration.
VENTURE/portfolio/data-cleanup-case-study/raw_food_inspections.csv
VENTURE/portfolio/data-cleanup-case-study/cleaned.csv
